      "side": 1,
      "message": "I found what caused my issues running these test:\n\nI had set `feature.experimental \u003d true` in `~/.gitconfig` and since git 2.51.0 this enables usage of `reftable` format for storing refs by default. The failing maintenance script tests assume that the repository uses traditional ref storage format `files`. Setting `feature.experimental\u003dfalse` fixed the test failures.\n\nRelease notes of git 2.51.0 mention that starting with git 3.0 reftable will be the default ref storage format.\n \nsee \nhttps://github.com/git/git/commit/793b14e1c833dd4ea0d85cdef53cc5ab38f7915e\nhttps://github.com/git/git/blob/master/Documentation/RelNotes/2.51.0.adoc",
